<title>USA: Nine West Group buys Pied a Terre for $5 mln.</title>
<headline>Nine West Group buys Pied a Terre for $5 mln.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Connecticut 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine West Group Inc said Thursday it had bought for $5 million the assets and operations of Pied a Terre Ltd, a footwear and apparel retailer in London.</p>
<p>It said Pied a Terre had 17 stores in the United Kingdom with $13 million in revenues in the last fiscal year.</p>
